{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2448000/extras/3b7b9a3975dc6546bed36717cc52b697.avif?t=1709652450\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br><strong><i>&quot;Frog King: Survive Bosses and Claim the Crown at the Top!&quot;</i></strong> Undertake on a daring adventure through diverse environments, facing off against multiple challenging bosses. Dodge their relentless pursuit, collect power-ups to aid your ascent, and learn valuable lessons from every stumble..<br><br><i>Jump King was originally made for the <u>Ludwig GameJam -</u> where it won!</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2448000/extras/a5dd28046a71a4e5257c712e974eb4f6.avif?t=1709652450\" width=600 height=200 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2><strong>-Prepare for high-stakes platforming!</strong><br>The world holds many great foes and the only way past them is going up, Tension rises with each world as any mistake could lead to a great fall.<br><br><strong>-Several movement abilities!</strong><br>You'll find many power ups that greatly change the way you platform in Frog King!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The higher you get, the harder you fall<br></li><li>Customizable character<br></li><li>Challenging and unique bosses<br></li><li>Unique quests<br></li><li>Cosmetics</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2448000/extras/19edde3bc3f726e6c1ef19a5d9359782.poster.avif?t=1709652450\" width=200 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2448000/extras/19edde3bc3f726e6c1ef19a5d9359782.webm?t=1709652450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2448000/ex